usage: worker_runner_capture.py [-h] [--output OUTPUT]
                                [--read-only-host-capture]

Read-only Windows runner observations. No AWS requests or build authority.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --output OUTPUT
  --read-only-host-capture

Exit 0: measured source-only observations. Exit 2: invalid configuration,
unsupported host or bounded capture failure. No AWS request or build
admission.
